{"reviews":[{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-0","r":4.0,"t":"and it does not look like a three-dollar item","x":"Comb is absolutely gorgeous. The jewels are lovely, and it does not look like a three-dollar item. My only criticism is that ends of the teeth of the comb are not smooth, making it somewhat difficult to insert into thick hair like mine. A tooth bent a bit, and when I tried to bend it back, it completely broke off. However, I am still completely satisfied with my purchase. It is a beautiful addition to my collection.","h":15,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-1","r":5.0,"t":"amazing","x":"the color is so beautiful and i love how it looks! for the price it is worth it !!! i love it","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-2","r":5.0,"t":"beautiful","x":"This is not only very pretty and unlike anything you would see locally,but it is incredibly strong heavy and well made.I will and have bought this product and more from this company and will without a doubt keep buying hair accessories from them as long as they keep selling them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-3","r":5.0,"t":"soooo pretty..","x":"soooo pretty..... these pics don't do these justice...and when it's in my hair, I get so many compliments on these, .... I am a hair bob junkie now thanks to these affordable gorgeous clips, combs... :)","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-4","r":5.0,"t":"... I would give this comb a try as I like to put my hair up when I get too ...","x":"I thought I would give this comb a try as I like to put my hair up when I get too warm.  It stays in place really well and is pretty as well.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-5","r":3.0,"t":"pretty","x":"Really pretty also very heavy...works awsome in a bun or somthing in that manner...or if you have really thick hair","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-6","r":3.0,"t":"Wouldn't stay in hair","x":"I loved it but, wouldn't stay in hair. I wish it would have worked in my hair! It is beautiful!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-7","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"This comb is very pretty but very cheaply made so it won't be pretty for long.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-8","r":4.0,"t":"Very pretty!","x":"Because this was so inexpensive I was afraid it might be junky and garish, but it's actually very pretty and delicate looking. The comb is very heavy and since I have fine hair have a hard time keeping it in unless it is anchored by other pins, but the effect in my almost white hair is very nice.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-9","r":5.0,"t":"So Pretty!","x":"I ordered this to wear in an updo for a black tie wedding.  It was just lovely and completed my entire look.  So pretty!  I hope to wear it again someday.  It's well made and not flimsy. Looks like a far more expensive piece.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-10","r":1.0,"t":"Baaaaad Quality and off color","x":"Same clip, but not as pink as in picture and has a lighter gold tint. Metal bends really easy. Not worth the money and disappointed. Would recommend for customers to look else where.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-11","r":5.0,"t":"This piece is beautiful. A little heavy","x":"This piece is beautiful. A little heavy,but well made. Shipping is very fast. Oh and thank you for the beautiful extra. That's so cool. You need to get this, it's awesome.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-12","r":5.0,"t":"A beautiful piece","x":"This turned out to be a beautiful piece. The workmanship for the price can't be beat. Only warning if you don't gave thicker hair it might not stay in since it us heavy.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-13","r":5.0,"t":"simple elegance","x":"A elegant and simple way to accessocize an outfit. The colors are beautiful and eye catching. I recommend also using with a shawl for the nights you need a light wrap.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-14","r":1.0,"t":"Flimsy and won't hold hair","x":"Don't waste your time and money on this product.  It's flimsy and cheap material. It won't hold hair in place no matter the hair style or texture...","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-15","r":5.0,"t":"very pretty","x":"this pic doesnt make justice to this hair comb. its so pretty!!!  You need to have thick or long hair to use it, wont work with straight hair.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-16","r":1.0,"t":"Not as pictured!! Not at all.","x":"Not at all as it appears in the photo!! Very cheaply made. Nice trinket for a little girls tea party.. but party favor quality only.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-17","r":5.0,"t":"I love the colors","x":"A stunning hair comb. I love the colors. The crystals sparkle beautifully. A great price. I receive many compliments when I wear it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-18","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful, sparkly","x":"Very pretty, nice sparkle, perfect for proms, weddings, formal events.  I would recommend it and would definitely buy again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-19","r":5.0,"t":"This type of comb works best with a chignon or a French twist","x":"This type of comb works best with a chignon or a French twist. It is great for a swept up &#34;do&#34; and is very pretty.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-20","r":1.0,"t":"Came with rhinestones already falling off. Also came with ...","x":"Came with rhinestones already falling off. Also came with a free large wood cross, which I really did not wish to receive.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2015"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-21","r":4.0,"t":"Nice!","x":"Light and easy to use. Nice detail work. I do prefer more vibrant colors to pastels but this is still a very nice item.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great Quality","x":"Happily surprised at the quality of this comb. Fortunately I have thick hair so they don't fall out.So very pretty.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-23","r":5.0,"t":"Rhinstone hair comb","x":"This hair comb is very pretty and made well. I love it. Hair comb in perfect condition and arrived on time.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00H9BLZP2-24","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"This beautiful peacock hair comb is real pretty poked into a ponytail.  The colors are soft and delicate.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the comb as beautiful and pretty, often noting it looks more expensive than its price.","cites":[1,2,3,4,5,9,10,12,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the comb heavy, which some say makes it hard to keep in place, especially in fine or thin hair.","cites":[6,9,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the comb won't stay in their hair or hold it in place.","cites":[7,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers criticize the build quality, calling it flimsy, cheaply made, or easily bent.","cites":[8,11,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the comb works well for thick hair or in a bun/updo.","cites":[5,6,10]}]},"qa":[]}